s('ctlcall',"The call","Tell the signaller the crossing point, name and employer, and time needed; stay on the phone","§3.5",{set:PHONE('iwa'),q:mu("What do you tell the signaller?",["The crossing point","Your name and employer","How long you need","Your PTS expiry date","What you're inspecting"],[0,1,2],[['Signaller','Signaller.']]),why:"<b>Crossing point, name and employer, time needed.</b> Cross straight away, stay on the phone, and tell them once you're clear."});
