s('nowork',"Lend a hand?","Lookouts take no part in the work and have no other duties","§4",{set:W=>{L(W);W.group(3,0,0)},q:pk("The group's behind and asks you to carry clips between trains.",["No: a lookout takes no part in the work and has no other duties","Yes, if no trains are due","Yes, if the COSS agrees","Light items only"]),why:"<b>No part in the work, no other duties.</b>"});
s('alert',"Wiped out","Don't act as lookout if you can't stay alert","§4",{set:L,q:pk("You've had no sleep and you're struggling to stay alert.",["Don't act as lookout: tell the COSS","Do it and drink coffee","Do it, but sit down","Ask a mate to nudge you"]),why:"<b>Don't act as a lookout if you can't stay alert.</b>"});
